sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Publisher
    participant R as Redis
    participant S as Subscriber

    P->>R: PUBLISH orders:new "order:1234"
    R->>S: Message "order:1234"

    S->>S: Process message
    S->>R: PUBLISH orders:ack "order:1234:success"
    R->>P: Message "order:1234:success"

    P->>P: Mark as processed

    Note over P,S: If no ACK received within timeout
    P->>R: PUBLISH orders:new "order:1234" (retry)
    R->>S: Message "order:1234"